Implemented all requested SOS cards: `sos_1`, `sos_4`, `sos_13`, `sos_57`, `sos_97`, `sos_120`, `sos_201`, `sos_226`, `sos_245`, and `sos_257`.

This included the card implementations plus the engine work they needed: attack-trigger emission and targeted-trigger support, planeswalker spell damage, next-main-phase scheduling, prepared-state and color surfaces, deterministic coin flips and skipped turns, miracle/alternate-cost handling, granted casualty and spell-cast events, battlefield-granted cost reduction, and restricted mana enforcement. I also updated `KEY_DECISIONS.md`, `RUN_DECISIONS.md`, `FILES_MODIFIED.json`, and `MODEL_AUDIT.jsonl`, and committed each card separately.

